from our team.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Please read this Refund Policy carefully before engaging our services. By making a payment to GoBright, you agree to the terms outlined in this policy.</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">2. Advance Payment &amp; Project Initiation</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">GoBright requires an advance payment (typically 50%-100% depending on the project scope) before commencing any work.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">This advance payment covers initial research, planning, strategy, and resource allocation.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Advance payments are non-refundable once project work has commenced.</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">3. Non-Refundable Services</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">The following services are strictly non-refundable once work has begun:</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Brand Strategy &amp; Positioning</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Logo Design &amp; Brand Identity Development</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Social Media Marketing Campaigns (once campaigns are live)</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Google Ads &amp; Meta Ads (once ad spend has been utilized)</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- SEO Services (after the first month of work)</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Photography &amp; Videography (after shoot completion)</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Website Design &amp; Development (after design approval)</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Printing, Signage &amp; Packaging (once production has started)</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Interior &amp; Office Branding (once installation has begun)</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">4. Refund Eligibility</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">A refund may be considered only in the following circumstances:</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- GoBright is unable to deliver the agreed service due to circumstances entirely within our control.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- A project is cancelled before any work has commenced and before resources have been allocated.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- A duplicate payment has been made by the client in error.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Refund requests must be submitted in writing to info.gobrightglobal@gmail.com within 7 days of the triggering event.</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">5. Cancellation Policy</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">If a client wishes to cancel a project mid-way, the following applies:</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- All work completed up to the cancellation date will be billed at the agreed rate.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- If the advance paid is less than the value of work completed, the client will be invoiced for the difference.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- If the advance paid exceeds the value of work completed, a partial refund may be issued at GoBright&#x27;s discretion.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">- Cancellation must be communicated in writing with at least 15 days&#x27; notice.</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">6. Revision &amp; Dissatisfaction Policy</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">GoBright offers a defined number of revisions as specified in the project proposal. Dissatisfaction with creative direction is not grounds for a refund if the deliverables align with the agreed brief.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">If you are unhappy with the work, we encourage open communication and will make every reasonable effort to address your concerns within the agreed revision scope.</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">7. Digital Marketing &amp; Ad Spend</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Ad spend (Meta Ads, Google Ads) paid directly to advertising platforms is non-refundable. GoBright does not control platform refund policies.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Service fees paid to GoBright for managing campaigns are non-refundable once the campaign management period has commenced.</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">8. Refund Processing</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Approved refunds will be processed within 7-14 business days via the original payment method or bank transfer.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">GoBright will not be responsible for any delays caused by banks or payment gateways.</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">9. Dispute Resolution</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">In the event of a dispute, both parties agree to first attempt resolution through direct communication.</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">If resolution cannot be reached, the matter shall be subject to arbitration under Indian law, with jurisdiction in Trichy, Tamil Nadu.</p></div></div><div class="bg-[#111] border border-[#1e1e1e] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-[#e32028] font-bold text-lg mb-4">10. Contact Us</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">For any refund-related queries, please contact us:</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Email: info.gobrightglobal@gmail.com</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Email 2: gobright.growth@gmail.com</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Phone: +91 89255 50774</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Secondary Phone: +91 95001 48123</p><p class="text-[#bbb] text-sm leading-relaxed">Address: No. 52/B, First Floor, Paradise Towers Complex, Thennur High Road, Trichy - 620017.</p></div></div></div></main><section class="bg-[#0d0d0d] border-t border-[#1a1a1a]"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start"><div class="flex flex-col gap-7"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="w-10 h-[2px] bg-[#e32028]"></span><span class="text-[#e32028] text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Find Us</span></div><h3 class="text-white text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Visit <span class="text-[#e32028]">GoBright</span></h3><p class="text-[#666] text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-sm">We&#x27;re always happy to meet in person. Come visit us or reach out through any channel below.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[#2a2a2a] w-full h-64 sm:h-72"><iframe title="GoBright Location" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3918.9177165443275!2d78.68266737451772!3d10.817608858433841!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3baaf5d9bcffb7e7%3A0xb301280f35b47dbf!2sGoBright%20%7C%20Branding%20%26%20Digital%20Marketing